  message: "DONE: merged in PR #1379 (commit 0df722ce8c; integration resolved the shared depends_on / edge_types / KNOWN_HOLES lines with WI-lahub). @callback / @macrocallback produce abstract symbols on the behaviour module (never call targets); @behaviour X and `use X` where X's __using__ sets the behaviour (library table from upstream sources; in-repo __using__ read, nested use followed, cycles stopped) emit implements to X; each callback dispatches_to the implementing module's public clauses of the same name and kind. Behavioural evidence: the parity fixture through run_behavior_map now gives Square -implements-> Shape and Shape.area -dispatches_to-> Square.area (dev: neither); the elixir KNOWN_HOLES entry is removed and the cell passes. Corpus (no edge removed anywhere; callback symbols equal grep @callback counts): phoenix +60 callbacks / +95 implements / +146 dispatch; plausible 40/59/108; livebook 3/50/12; nex-framework 2/12/10; random sample of 25 added edges all correct. Residuals: WI-nunar (P2, use AppWeb, :live_view), WI-hidit (P2, Erlang -callback), WI-forof (P2, defprotocol/defimpl). Report: run_09302026/vitas.md"  # 9e22
